# Packages that must NEVER be installed on a TEST machine (gringotts, hogshead, madammalkins): the owner's personal apps.
# Test machines run the public Horcrux editions + test tooling + machine HARDWARE enablement only (owner order 2026-11-05).
# One shell glob per line on cat/pkg. Enforced by horcrux-test-machine-check (lab hx-invariants) and by blockers in the ebuild.
# NOT here (they are agent plumbing the test machines need): app-admin/rustinion-agent, app-backup/restic, net-misc/ctg-ssh-ca-fleet.
# Tailscale is retired (2026-11-10, WireGuard hub on kingscross replaces it): it must be ABSENT from every test machine
